/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 94 0 R
/E (The proposed system uses AI and computer vision to detect and recognize faces in real time. A camera captures the individual's face, converts it into face encodings \(numerical data\), and compares them against a stored database of authorized personnel. Access is granted only on a match; otherwise, entry is denied and security is alerted.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
