<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 98 0 R
/E (Traditional access methods \(ID cards, passwords, manual verification\) are inefficient, time-consuming, and vulnerable. ID cards can be stolen or duplicated; passwords can be shared; manual checks introduce errors and delays. In defence zones, even a small breach can have serious consequences, making these methods unreliable. An automated, real-time identification system is needed.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
